  "onboardingPrivacyTitle": "Where your requests are processed",
  "@onboardingPrivacyTitle": {
    "description": "Onboarding page 2 title: where requests are processed. Must not claim that everything stays with AURA: Engineer turns go to Anthropic after consent (D-02, D-03)"
  },
  "onboardingPrivacyBody": "Nothing is processed on this phone. Your documents, memories and files are only read by AI models AURA runs itself. The exception is the Engineer: once you agree in the app, the messages you send it, the files it opens and the output of the commands it runs go to Claude, an AI model run by Anthropic. Other messages may be answered by an approved hosted AI provider, if the server’s operator allows it.",
  "@onboardingPrivacyBody": {
    "description": "Onboarding page 2 body. Must match the backend's routing: sensitive content stays on self-hosted models (ADR-030), except Engineer turns, which go to Claude (Anthropic) only after the user's in-app consent (ADR-033 amendment, D-02/D-03); hosted open-weight providers are opt-in and see only internal-classified requests"
  },
